        <div class="about-content">

          <h2 class="section-title">
            <span class="small">Our</span>
            <span class="large">Story</span>
          </h2>

          <span class="section-tagline">
            Where Beauty Meets Purpose
          </span>

          <p>
            Dunamiss Cosmetics is an Indian beauty brand built around a simple
            idea: beauty should help you feel confident in your own skin.
            From everyday care to expressive colour, we create products that
            bring together thoughtful formulas and the joy of getting ready.
          </p>
          <p>Our approach starts with the person behind the routine: what you enjoy, how you express yourself, and the care you make time for. We want choosing beauty to feel considered, comfortable, and entirely your own.</p>
          <p class="about-inline-note">Created by women. Inspired by everyday beauty.</p>

