  <section id="our-values" class="about-section about-values-section">
    <div class="about-container fluid_container">
      <header class="about-section-header"><p class="about-eyebrow">What matters to us</p><h2>Our values, in everyday practice.</h2><p>Three ideas shape how we think about beauty and the experience we want to create.</p></header>
      <div class="about-values-grid">
        <article class="about-value"><span class="about-value-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Care comes first</h3><p>A beauty routine should be a moment of attention to yourself. We value thoughtful choices and clear information that help you find what works for you.</p></article>
        <article class="about-value"><span class="about-value-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Confidence is personal</h3><p>A subtle finish or a bold lip: there is room for both. We celebrate self-expression without asking everyone to follow the same idea of beauty.</p></article>
        <article class="about-value"><span class="about-value-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Make room for curiosity</h3><p>Understanding your products is part of enjoying them. We encourage you to explore ingredients, application tips, and the details behind each formula.</p></article>
